,["pc","hq"],["hs","sh"],["at","West's heart opening lead is won by South. "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","nd"],["hs","sd"],["hs","wd"],["md","0,s8,,d2"],["at","Even if the defenders have to take their @DA on the first or second round, South will have only 8 tricks (2 hearts, 4 diamonds, and 2 clubs). "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["ls","sd"],["ls","wd"],["hs","nc"],["hs","sc"],["hs","ec"],["at","South will still need an extra club trick (presumably by finessing against the @CQ) for his 9th trick. "],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["ls","sc"],["ls","ec"],["md","0,cqd2,,s8c5"],["hs","sc"],["hs","wc"],["nt","South should lead the @CA or @CK at trick 2 (in case West has a singleton @CQ). "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["pc","ca"],["md","0,c5,,cq"],["hs","ec"],["hs","wc"],["at","When both defenders follow small, "],["pg",""],["ls","ec"],["ls","wc"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","sd"],["hs","nd"],["at","South should lead either the @DQ and overtake with dummy's @DK, or lead the @D10 or @D9 and overtake with dummy's @DJ. "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["ls","sd"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","dj"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","nc"],["hs","sc"],["at","When this wins, South should finesse against the @CQ with East (South needs this finesse in any case). "],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["ls","sc"],["ls","ec"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","cj"],["hs","ws"],["at","West discards a spade "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hs","nc"],["hs","sc"],["hs","ec"],["at","revealing that South must finesse again in order to pick up the clubs."],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["ls","sc"],["ls","ec"],["hs","sd"],["hs","wd"],["nt","South leads another diamond and West follows small "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["ls","wd"],["pc","dq"],["pc","d"],["hs","nd"],["at","leaving South with a decision as to which diamond should be played from the dummy. "],["pg",""],["hs","wd"],["at","The @DK will be the winning play if West started with 3 or 4 diamonds to the @DA. It will win